{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f8b299e2-a5b3-88f4-b4fb-5b44c9143497",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T12:39:45-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Mensah",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:37:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:37:17-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. David Mensah. I'm calling about a fire hydrant that's buried, and I'm going to have to be quick, my manager asked me to cover a shift so I've got to be out the door in a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:37:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, no problem, let's get right to it. Where is the hydrant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:37:37-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in front of 311 Dixon Street, in the North End. That's my mother's house. So, last Tuesday we got that bigger snow, and the plow came through that night and pushed everything up against the curb. Then Thursday it was all frozen solid. And now this week we've had this cold snap and just a dusting overnight, nothing much, but the hydrant is still completely buried under that bank. You can barely see the top of the cap."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:38:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so the hydrant at 311 Dixon, buried in the snowbank from the plow last week, and it's still there with the cold. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it. I shoveled out her walk Sunday, but I'm not digging out a hydrant through ice that's been sitting a week. That's the city's bank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:38:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Is it right at the curb in front of the house, or is it next to the neighbor's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:38:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in front of her place. Maybe a few feet over toward the corner, but it's her side of the street, the odd numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:38:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll put that in as a buried hydrant on the odd side of Dixon near 311, so it gets flagged for the crews."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So when is it going to get cleared? Because I called about a different thing last year and nobody ever told me anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:39:06-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hydrants are usually a priority for the crews, so it should be sooner rather than later, probably in the next day or two, depending on what else is on their list. I can't see their schedule from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:39:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two. Alright. Do you need a number in case somebody wants to check with me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:39:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, what's the best callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:39:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-three. And that's under David Mensah, for the house at 311 Dixon Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Okay, I've gotta run. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:39:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, David. Drive safe out there."
    }
  ],
